&lt;td colspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;"&gt;付与対象者の区分及び人数：当社取締役3名&lt;/p&gt;
